[quote="Chaosmancer"]

So, if we are looking at the Akash&#39;Flora tree and for some reason add in &quot;Reckless Police&quot; (only action taking threat I can think of for Megalopolis) as an Environment threat then what do we have?

[/quote]

First, important to note here that a Megalopolis Environment (capital E-environment as far as rules goes and not just the setting for the scene) it would have a writeup that includes other possible twists for the Environment to do on its turn - like Insula Primalis and Tomb of Anubis have but not anything in issue 1.

> 

1) Robot Spiders take turns as minions, followed by Megalopolis Environment taking a turn and activating police2) Robot Spiders take turns as minions, Police take turns as Minions, then Megalopois Environment takes a turn and does something else entirely 3) Something else entirely like the Police getting activated twice or something.

Robot Spiders would have their own slot in the Action Order. They&#39;re villains/bad guys/etc.&nbsp;

The Environment also has a slot in the Action Order, under which the following things would happen (GM can choose which order): 1. Advance Scene Tracker, 2. have all Environment-created minions act, and 3. introduce new environment threat (if it doesn&#39;t have one already) OR activate one of its twists based on the status of the scene.&nbsp;

Hope that clears it up.&nbsp;
